cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use dataProfilerR, please cite it as below."
title: "dataProfilerR: Automated Exploratory Data Analysis and Dataset Profiling"
abstract: >-
  Profiles a data frame with minimal input: column type inference, missing-value analysis, distributional statistics, normality tests, outlier detection, correlation and categorical association, and an overall data-quality score.
